    "Condition : 2 - A 2m high replacement tree of the same species, is to be planted in the same location, in the first available planting season following the removal of the tree hereby permitted, unless a variation to this is agreed in writing with the local planning authority.  Confirmation when planting has taken place should be sent to trees@wandsworth.gov.uk \r\nReason: To preserve the visual amenity of the area in accordance with Planning Practice Guidance on Tree Preservation Orders and to safeguard the appearance of the locality, in accordance with Council policy LP56 of the Local Plan.\r\n"
